# Oh My Novelist - Anthropic compatibility path
# Preferred provider setup now lives in OpenCode (`/connect`, `/models`, provider config).
# This env var remains for transitional Anthropic-first compatibility when no
# oh-my-novelist.jsonc policy file is present.
# Get your API key from: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
